  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusion of vulnerable girls and boys in basic education, including Syrian refugees (UNICEF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support UNICEF maintain camp school operations in refugee camps in Jordan. It will also support assistive devices and transportation for children with disabilities; an out of school children study; and a social and behaviour change study on harm prevention.</narrative>
  </description>
